<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Evaluation results after three different BFA. We evaluated five models under two quantization settings (INT8/FP4), applying three different BFA methods. In our experiments, for all methods, we set
<math id="S4.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{\mathrm{bits}}=50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>bits</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{\mathrm{bits}}=50</annotation></semantics></math> for the INT8-quantized model and
<math id="S4.T2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{\mathrm{bits}}=100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>bits</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{\mathrm{bits}}=100</annotation></semantics></math> for the FP4-quantized model, and
for our SilentStriker method we set
<math id="S4.T2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="top_{\mathrm{K}}=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">top_{\mathrm{K}}=10</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.T2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{q}=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{q}=2</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
